      "message": "fix(2d): a start-side edit of a seeded 2D Offset takes the Arc entry\n\nA new 2D Offset seeds Pass starts at Auto and the Helix entry. When an\nedit moved it to Inside or Outside, the entry stayed Helix, and #3748's\nEntryNotRecommended warning showed for an operation the user did not\nchange. EditOperationParams now applies OpParams::with_start_side_entry:\nan edit that moves pass_start off Auto and keeps the Helix entry sets\nArc in the same undoable edit. A user's own entry choice stays.\n\nFixes #3843\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
